# Exemptions for hack/check_internal_tokens.py: '<glob> <groups> # reason'.
# The reason is mandatory; an exemption that matches no tracked file fails the
# check; use '*' for every group only when the file is itself internal
# plumbing. Only deployment configuration that never leaves this repository
# belongs here; code, tests, docs and runbooks are fixed instead. muse/,
# charts/muse/ and meta-internal/ are exempt by classification in the checker.
.buildkite/**                              storage,repos,clusters,org-tooling,org-domains  # CI pipeline: registries, agent queues, mirrors
charts/ome-isvc/**                         codenames,org-tooling,storage  # internal vendor bundles and example values, never shipped
charts/ome-resources/values-usc1-*.yaml    *        # per-cluster install overlay, never shipped
charts/ome-resources/tests/render_test.sh  clusters # renders that overlay; the block is carved from the public copy
hack/model-download/**                     org-tooling,org-domains,storage  # blob-store download tooling that only works on internal clusters
docs/RELEASE.md                            storage,repos,clusters  # internal release process
hack/check_internal_tokens_test.py         *        # the checker's own fixtures
hack/internal-tokens.txt                   *        # the pattern list itself
hack/internal-tokens.allow                 *        # this file
